riation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->3 easy ways to send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending a parcel with Evri is quick and easy. We offer a wide range of convenient delivery services across the UK and internationally. There are 3 EASY ways to send a parcel:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_286351d0.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Take your parcel to a ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your local Evri ParcelShop is a convenient alternative to a Post Office. You can book online, with the Evri app or –if the shop has a Print In ParcelShop device– just turn up with your parcel. Whichever way you choose, you can use our Print In ParcelShop devices to print your label if you don’t have a printer.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find a ParcelShop-open Find a ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop982c?parcelshop=true" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find a ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033aebd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Drop off your parcel at a Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have Lockers placed in neighbourhoods across the UK. They’re open 24/7, are covered by CCTV and are located in convenient places, like supermarkets. Our largest Locker is 62cm x 39cm x 57cm – plenty of room for bigger parcels. Find your nearest Locker and book online or with our app.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find a Locker-open Find a Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshopa177?lockers=true" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find a Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Arrange a Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Let us collect your parcel from you with our door-to-door courier service. Choose when you’d like us to collect it – up to 7 days in advance – and we’ll deliver it within 3 to 5 days from collection. Available with Standard delivery, book your Courier collection now, either online or with the Evri app, available on the App Store and Google Play.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel-open Send a parcel page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="2" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-90dc4169><div id="how-to-send-your-parcel-with-evri-online" class="photo-list__text-container" data-v-90dc4169><h2 class="photo-list__title" data-v-90dc4169>How to send your parcel with Evri online</h2><p class="photo-list__desc" data-v-90dc4169>Sending your parcels with Evri is QUICK and EASY.</p></div><!--[--><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A father is measuring the sides of his parcel at home at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him" width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><span data-v-805cf62b>1.</span> Fill in the basics</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tell us where it&#39;s going, where it&#39;s coming from and how much it weighs – our maximum weight is 15kg, and you can find out about our size guidelines <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/parcel-size-and-weight-guide" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->here<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Parcels are priced by weight, so whether your parcel is <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/large-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->large<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/small-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->small<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->,<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> it&#39;s important to give an accurate weight.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier is taking a photo confirmation of a successful delivery whilst the customer holds the parcels in clear view." width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><span data-v-805cf62b>2.</span> Choose your delivery service</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You have two simple services to choose from: <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Next Day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – drop off at a<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops/lockers" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> by 12pm on a working day and we’ll do our best to deliver the next working day. It’ll take longer if you drop off at the weekend – see ‘<!--]--><!--]--><a href="/terms-and-conditions" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our Service Commitment<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->’ to you. <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Standard<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – send your parcel from a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, or <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/courier-service" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->arrange Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. We’ll deliver it within 2 to 5 days. <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Use our website<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/mobile-app" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri app<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to book your parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-8a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking at their screen. The display shows the customer is reading about our three easy ways to return a parcel" width="1000" height="667" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><span data-v-805cf62b>3.</span> Fill in your parcel details</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Let us know what’s in your parcel (<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->read our simple guide on what you can and can’t send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->) and how much it’s worth. We include £20 cover for FREE and, for peace of mind, you can increase the cover if your parcel’s worth more. You can also request a digital signature as proof of delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer sat at a desk in their office taking a phone call and looking at a laptop." width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><span data-v-805cf62b>4.</span> Let us know where it&#39;s going</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tell us where your parcel is going and – if you’d like your recipient to receive tracking updates – add their email address. We’ll also ask if there’s a safe place where we can deliver the parcel, as well as a return address, your email address and phone number, just in case we can’t deliver the parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1af68.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C5994%2C3986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C5994%2C3986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C6%2C5994%2C3986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a ParcelShop Print in Store device printing a label. A hand is holding the label, ready to tear off and apply to the parcel." width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><span data-v-805cf62b>5.</span> Pay and print your parcel</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All you need to do now is pay then print your label. If you don’t have a printer, you can use a Print In ParcelShop device at most of our ParcelShops – you can <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop0fb3?printinparcelshop=true" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->find your nearest one here<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="where-can-i-send-parcels-to?" class="section-wrapper" index="3" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier is scanning the barcode of a single parcel as he approaches the doorstep of a home in a residential area. He is there to make a delivery." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Where can I send parcels to?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can send parcels across the UK with Evri – the only exemptions are the Channel Islands, PO Boxes and British Forces Post Office locations. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Some locations cost us more to deliver to; we may add a location charge of £2.75 when sending parcels to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/location-charge-postcodes" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->certain postcodes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> (unless sending to the same postcode area the parcel is sent from e.g BT2 to BT18).<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We also deliver parcels to over 200+ countries and territories across the world. Simply book your parcel online and send using our Courier collection service, ParcelShops or Lockers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find out more about our delivery service to cities across the UK: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="feature_link_cards" class="section-wrapper feature-link-cards" index="4" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><div class="feature-link-cards__cards" data-v-5ebb0713><!--[--><a href="/our-services/parcel-to-london" class="e-link-card e-link-card--small-on-desktop e-link-card--href feature-link-cards__card" data-test-id="e-link-card" data-v-5ebb0713 data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__left" data-v-92810816><!----><div data-v-92810816><div class="e-link-card__title" data-test-id="e-link-card-title" data-v-92810816>Send a parcel to London <!----></div><div class="e-link-card__description" data-test-id="e-link-card-description" data-v-92810816><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="e-icon e-link-card__right-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_circle_right" data-test-id="chevron_circle_right" data-v-92810816 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.68 12L10.3 14.38C10.12 14.56 10.03 14.79 10.03 15.06C10.03 15.34 10.12 15.57 10.3 15.78C10.5 15.97 10.74 16.07 11.01 16.07C11.29 16.07 11.53 15.97 11.72 15.78L14.8 12.7C15 12.5 15.1 12.27 15.1 12C15.1 11.73 15 11.5 14.8 11.3L11.7 8.2C11.5 8 11.27 7.9 11 7.91C10.73 7.92 10.5 8.03 10.3 8.22C10.12 8.43 10.02 8.66 10.01 8.93C10 9.19 10.1 9.43 10.3 9.62L12.68 12ZM12 22C10.62 22 9.32 21.74 8.1 21.21C6.88 20.69 5.83 19.98 4.92 19.07C4.03 18.18 3.31 17.12 2.79 15.9C2.26 14.68 2 13.38 2 12C2 10.62 2.26 9.32 2.79 8.1C3.31 6.88 4.03 5.83 4.92 4.92C5.83 4.03 6.88 3.31 8.1 2.79C9.32 2.