n" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I buy cover for my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I buy cover for my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We include £20 cover on most items for free. If your parcel’s value is more than £20, you can increase the value of cover for your item up to £999. Please note that prohibited items and postable parcels aren’t covered, whatever their value. As well as prohibited items, there are some items you can send with us, but we can&#39;t offer cover on them. These are called <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->non-compensation items<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and include china, glassware, furniture, musical instruments, TVs and monitors, passports and legal documents, jewellery over £999 in value, separate parcels strapped or taped together, and badly packaged parcels. We’re happy to carry <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->non-compensation items<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for delivery, but when you send any of these items it’s at your own risk<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I change the delivery address after I’ve sent a parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I change the delivery address after I’ve sent a parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canichangethedeliveryaddressafterivesentaparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes. If it’s a simple house name/number change, the easiest thing to do is ask the parcel recipient to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->divert the parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to the correct house name/number. If your recipient needs a full address change, keep your eye on the tracking and contact our customer service team with the change you need once the parcel is with the courier. We’ll do our best to get the parcel stopped, and the address corrected before the delivery is made to the original address.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howwilliknowwhenmyparcelhasbeendelivered-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="ac