o-send-a-parcel":512},{"uid":6,"document":7,"postSlices":511},"how-to-send-a-parcel",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":22,"slices":23},"How to Send a Parcel UK | Courier Collection & Drop Off  | Evri","Find out how to send a parcel with Evri. Take your parcel to a drop off shop or Locker, or arrange a Courier collection.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-send-a-parcel",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":18,"uid":16,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"Yhjy_BIAAC0A3CBt","subpath1",[],"en-gb","send","2022-02-25T15:17:21+0000","2022-03-09T20:17:54+0000","Document","2d983328-a294-432d-8e29-571227191cac",false,{"link_type":19},[24,46,133,313,348,394,441,466],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":37,"id":43,"slice_type":44,"slice_label":45},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[28],{"contentRight":29},{"id":30,"type":31,"tags":32,"lang":15,"slug":33,"first_publication_date":34,"last_publication_date":35,"link_type":19,"key":36,"isBroken":21},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","6df3e4b3-25fb-45e1-9305-829e0bd14df2",{"heading":38,"includeInternational":39,"desktopBackground":40,"tabletBackground":41,"mobileBackground":42},"How to send a parcel",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$27bde040-eded-4333-a1dd-50d90ab8ef13","hero_banner",null,{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":48,"primary":121,"id":131,"slice_type":132,"slice_label":45},"3Column",[49,79,101],{"Title":50,"Description":55,"Image":60,"Label":45,"UrlText":72,"Url":73,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":77,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[51],{"type":52,"text":53,"spans":54},"heading3","Take your parcel to a ParcelShop",[],[56],{"type":57,"text":58,"spans":59},"paragraph","Your local Evri ParcelShop is a convenient alternative to a Post Office. You can book online, with the Evri app or –if the shop has a Print In ParcelShop device– just turn up with your parcel. Whichever way you choose, you can use our Print In ParcelShop devices to print your label if you don’t have a printer.",[],{"dimensions":61,"alt":64,"copyright":45,"url":65,"id":66,"edit":67},{"width":62,"height":63},1000,665,"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C7723%2C5136&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},0,8,1,"transparent","Find a ParcelShop",{"link_type":74,"key":75,"url":76},"Web","16be4ee8-8edd-4547-b174-fad5bcbd004c","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?parcelshop=true",{"link_type":78},"Any",{"Title":80,"Description":85,"Image":89,"Label":45,"UrlText":96,"Url":97,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":100,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[81],{"type":52,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":84},"Drop off your parcel at a Locker",[],"ltr",[86],{"type":57,"text":87,"spans":88,"direction":84},"We have Lockers placed in neighbourhoods across the UK. They’re open 24\u002F7, are covered by CCTV and are located in convenient places, like supermarkets. Our largest Locker is 62cm x 39cm x 57cm – plenty of room for bigger parcels. Find your nearest Locker and book online or with our app.",[],{"dimensions":90,"alt":91,"copyright":45,"url":92,"id":93,"edit":94},{"width":62,"height":63},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":68,"y":95,"zoom":70,"background":71},17,"Find a Locker",{"link_type":74,"key":98,"url":99},"193fa656-8ccf-4633-ab3d-f35437a56d0f","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?lockers=true",{"link_type":78},{"Title":102,"Description":106,"Image":110,"Label":45,"UrlText":116,"Url":117,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":120,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[103],{"type":52,"text":104,"spans":105},"Arrange a Courier collection",[],[107],{"type":57,"text":108,"spans":109},"Let us collect your parcel from you with our door-to-door courier service. Choose when you’d like us to collect it – up to 7 days in advance – and we’ll deliver it within 3 to 5 days from collection. Available with Standard delivery, book your Courier collection now, either online or with the Evri app, available on the App Store and Google Play.",[],{"dimensions":111,"alt":112,"copyright":45,"url":113,"id":114,"edit":115},{"width":62,"height":63},"An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},"Send a parcel",{"link_type":74,"key":118,"url":119},"289239e1-124a-41a9-898f-dd58cbe17102","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"link_type":78},{"SectionTitle":122,"SectionDescription":127,"theme":45},[123],{"type":124,"text":125,"spans":126},"heading2","3 easy ways to send",[],[128],{"type":57,"text":129,"spans":130},"Sending a parcel with Evri is quick and easy. We offer a wide range of convenient delivery services across the UK and internationally. There are 3 EASY ways to send a parcel:",[],"article_link_module$562949b7-420b-4f01-b049-e53f69c4f7d6","article_link_module",{"variation":134,"version":26,"items":135,"primary":308,"id":311,"slice_type":312,"slice_label":45},"photoListComponent",[136,177,258,277,289],{"title":137,"content":138,"isNumbered":39,"image":171},"Fill in the basics",[139],{"type":57,"text":140,"spans":141},"Tell us where it's going, where it's coming from and how much it weighs – our maximum weight is 15kg, and you can find out about our size guidelines here. Parcels are priced by weight, so whether your parcel is large or small, it's important to give an accurate weight.",[142,146,158,161,164,167],{"start":143,"end":144,"type":145},149,153,"strong",{"start":143,"end":144,"type":147,"data":148},"hyperlink",{"id":149,"type":150,"tags":151,"lang":15,"slug":153,"first_publication_date":154,"last_publication_date":155,"uid":156,"url":157,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YihsQxIAACsAIcAj","content-page",[152],"Send a Parcel","parcel-size--weight-guide--how-to-measure--weigh-a-parcel--evri","2022-03-09T08:59:08+0000","2026-07-09T07:02:15+0000","parcel-size-and-weight-guide","\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide",{"start":159,"end":160,"type":145},211,216,{"start":159,"end":160,"type":147,"data":162},{"link_type":74,"url":163},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Flarge-parcel",{"start":165,"end":166,"type":145},220,226,{"start":165,"end":168,"type":147,"data":169},225,{"link_type":74,"url":170},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fsmall-parcel",{"dimensions":172,"alt":173,"copyright":45,"url":174,"id":175,"edit":176},{"width":62,"height":63},"A father is measuring the sides of his parcel at home at his desk using measuring tape. His children are resting on the sofa behind him","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc_pbqstJ9-inX_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7760.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zc_pbqstJ9-inX",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},{"title":178,"content":179,"isNumbered":39,"image":252},"Choose your delivery service",[180],{"type":57,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":84},"You have two simple services to choose from: Next Day – drop off at a ParcelShop or Locker by 12pm on a working day and we’ll do our best to deliver the next working day. It’ll take longer if you drop off at the weekend – see ‘Our Service Commitment’ to you. Standard – send your parcel from a ParcelShop or Locker, or arrange Courier collection. We’ll deliver it within 2 to 5 days. Use our website or the Evri app to book your parcel",[183,186,189,200,211,212,224,225,228,234,235,240,241,245,246,251],{"start":184,"end":185,"type":145},45,53,{"start":187,"end":188,"type":145},69,80,{"start":190,"end":188,"type":147,"data":191},70,{"id":192,"type":150,"tags":193,"lang":15,"slug":195,"first_publication_date":196,"last_publication_date":197,"uid":198,"url":199,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhTflBEAACYA1FEy",[194],"ParcelShops","parcelshops--parcel-pick-up--drop-off-points--evri","2022-02-22T13:38:47+0000","2026-03-09T20:42:49+0000","parcelshops","\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":201,"end":202,"type":147,"data":203},84,90,{"id":204,"type":150,"tags":205,"lang":15,"slug":206,"first_publication_date":207,"last_publication_date":208,"uid":209,"url":210,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhaXWhIAACwA0p3N",[194],"parcel-delivery--collection-lockers--collect-parcels--evri","2022-02-23T20:43:57+0000","2026-01-05T01:50:51+0000","lockers","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":201,"end":202,"type":145},{"start":213,"end":214,"type":147,"data":215},227,249,{"id":216,"type":150,"tags":217,"lang":15,"slug":219,"first_publication_date":220,"last_publication_date":221,"uid":222,"url":223,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhiIfBIAACwA2nB3",[218],"Policies","full-terms-and-conditions","2022-03-04T12:24:13+0000","2026-04-29T14:12:11+0000","terms-and-conditions","\u002Fterms-and-conditions",{"start":213,"end":214,"type":145},{"start":226,"end":227,"type":145},259,267,{"start":229,"end":230,"type":147,"data":231},294,314,{"link_type":74,"url":232,"target":233},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop","_blank",{"start":229,"end":230,"type":145},{"start":236,"end":237,"type":147,"data":238},319,345,{"link_type":74,"url":239,"target":233},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"start":236,"end":237,"type":145},{"start":242,"end":243,"type":147,"data":244},384,399,{"link_type":74,"url":119,"target":233},{"start":242,"end":243,"type":145},{"start":247,"end":248,"type":147,"data":249},407,415,{"link_type":74,"url":250,"target":233},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fmobile-app",{"start":247,"end":248,"type":145},{"dimensions":253,"alt":254,"copyright":45,"url":255,"id":256,"edit":257},{"width":62,"height":63},"An Evri courier is taking a photo confirmation of a successful delivery whilst the customer holds the parcels in clear view.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdHJbqstJ9-inq_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8123.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdHJbqstJ9-inq",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},{"title":259,"content":260,"isNumbered":39,"image":270},"Fill in your parcel details",[261],{"type":57,"text":262,"spans":263},"Let us know what’s in your parcel (read our simple guide on what you can and can’t send) and how much it’s worth. We include £20 cover for FREE and, for peace of mind, you can increase the cover if your parcel’s worth more. You can also request a digital signature as proof of delivery.",[264,267],{"start":265,"end":266,"type":145},35,87,{"start":265,"end":266,"type":147,"data":268},{"link_type":74,"url":269},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"dimensions":271,"alt":273,"copyright":45,"url":274,"id":275,"edit":276},{"width":62,"height":272},667,"A customer sat on a sofa, holding their tablet and looking at their screen. The display shows the customer is reading about our three easy ways to return a parcel","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5657-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z7xwwZ7c43Q3gITF",{"x":68,"y":68,"zoom":70,"background":71},{"title":278,"content":279,"isNumbered":39,"image":283},"Let us know where it's going",[280],{"type":57,"text":281,"spans":282},"Tell us where your parcel is going and – if you’d like your recipient to receive tracking updates – add their email address. We’ll also ask if there’s a safe place where we can deliver the parcel, as well as a return address, your email address and phone number, just in case we can’t deliver the parcel.",[],{"dimensions":284,"alt":285,"copyright":45,"url":286,"id":287,"edit":288},{"width":62,"height":63},"Customer sat at a desk in their office taking a phone call and looking at a laptop.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R5s5bqstJ9-STg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8528.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R5s5bqstJ9-STg",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},{"title":290,"content":291,"isNumbered":39,"image":301},"Pay and print your parcel",[292],{"type":57,"text":293,"spans":294},"All you need to do now is pay then print your label. If you don’t have a printer, you can use a Print In ParcelShop device at most of our ParcelShops – you can find your nearest one here.",[295,298],{"start":296,"end":297,"type":145},160,186,{"start":296,"end":297,"type":147,"data":299},{"link_type":74,"url":300},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?printinparcelshop=true",{"dimensions":302,"alt":303,"copyright":45,"url":304,"id":305,"edit":306},{"width":62,"height":63},"A close-up of a ParcelShop Print in Store device printing a label. A hand is holding the label, ready to tear off and apply to the parcel.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C5994%2C3986&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG",{"x":68,"y":307,"zoom":70,"background":71},6,{"theme":45,"title":309,"description":310},"How to send your parcel with Evri online","Sending your parcels with Evri is QUICK and EASY.","list_block$65050efa-3dc9-490c-8f88-2c03d2c86627","list_block",{"variation":314,"version":26,"items":315,"primary":317,"id":346,"slice_type":347,"slice_label":45},"default-slice",[316],{},{"CardImage":318,"CardAvatar":324,"CardTitle":325,"CardText":326,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":345,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":319,"alt":320,"copyright":45,"url":321,"id":322,"edit":323},{"width":62,"height":63},"An Evri Courier is scanning the barcode of a single parcel as he approaches the doorstep of a home in a residential area. He is there to make a delivery.","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xVJbqstJ9-pUx_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0190.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69xVJbqstJ9-pUx",{"x":68,"y":69,"zoom":70,"background":71},"none","Where can I send parcels to?",[327,330,339,342],{"type":57,"text":328,"spans":329,"direction":84},"You can send parcels across the UK with Evri – the only exemptions are the Channel Islands, PO Boxes and British Forces Post Office locations. ",[],{"type":57,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":84},"Some locations cost us more to deliver to; we may add a location charge of £2.75 when sending parcels to certain postcodes (unless sending to the same postcode area the parcel is sent from e.g BT2 to BT18).",[333,338],{"start":334,"end":335,"type":147,"data":336},105,122,{"link_type":74,"url":337,"target":233},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Flocation-charge-postcodes",{"start":334,"end":335,"type":145},{"type":57,"text":340,"spans":341,"direction":84},"We also deliver parcels to over 200+ countries and territories across the world. Simply book your parcel online and send using our Courier collection service, ParcelShops or Lockers.",[],{"type":57,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":84},"Find out more about our delivery service to cities across the UK: ",[],{"link_type":78},"card$da670b43-99f9-4495-827d-14fd95fadf06","card",{"variation":314,"version":26,"items":349,"primary":391,"id":392,"slice_type":393,"slice_label":45},[350,361,371,381],{"title":351,"content":45,"pillEnabled":21,"link":352,"dataGtmTrack":45},"Send a parcel to London",{"id":353,"type":150,"tags":354,"lang":15,"slug":355,"first_publication_date":356,"last_publication_date":357,"uid":358,"url":359,"link_type":19,"key":360,"isBroken":21},"aAdkHhIAACEAHzEy",[],"drop-off-your-parcel-to-london-in-one-of-three-easy-ways","2025-04-24T10:19:01+0000","2026-04-20T23:02:48+0000","parcel-to-london","\u002Four-services\u002Fparcel-to-london","6ca75626-ee22-475f-96e0-8cede23b1203",{"title":362,"content":45,"pillEnabled":21,"link":363,"dataGtmTrack":45},"Send a parcel to Manchester",{"id":364,"type":150,"tags":365,"lang":15,"slug":366,"first_publication_date":367,"last_publication_date":155,"uid":368,"url":369,"link_type":19,"key":370,"isBroken":21},"aAdkIhIAACEAHzE7",[],"drop-off-your-parcel-to-manchester-in-one-of-three-easy-ways","2025-05-14T09:55:46+0000","parcel-to-manchester","\u002Four-services\u002Fparcel-to-manchester","47499bfb-76dc-4ee7-ad7d-360f34686625",{"title":372,"content":45,"pillEnabled":21,"link":373,"dataGtmTrack":45},"Send a parcel to Birmingham",{"id":374,"type":150,"tags":375,"lang":15,"slug":376,"first_publication_date":377,"last_publication_date":357,"uid":378,"url":379,"link_type":19,"key":380,"isBroken":21},"aAdkNBIAACEAHzFY",[],"drop-off-your-parcel-to-birmingham-in-one-of-three-easy-ways","2025-05-14T13:19:45+0000","parcel-to-birmingham","\u002Four-services\u002Fparcel-to-birmingham","9d1934fc-50c0-4ebd-a93e-d22