format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C774%2C7723%2C3603&w=343&h=160",{"x":68,"y":463,"zoom":70,"background":71},774,"photo_block$5250c120-9cdc-49e8-a950-3d2fcadf3cfb","photo_block",{"variation":314,"version":26,"items":467,"primary":507,"id":509,"slice_type":510,"slice_label":45},[468,484,496],{"questionTitle":469,"questionBody":470},"Can I buy cover for my parcel?",[471],{"type":57,"text":472,"spans":473,"direction":84},"We include £20 cover on most items for free. If your parcel’s value is more than £20, you can increase the value of cover for your item up to £999. Please note that prohibited items and postable parcels aren’t covered, whatever their value. As well as prohibited items, there are some items you can send with us, but we can't offer cover on them. These are called non-compensation items and include china, glassware, furniture, musical instruments, TVs and monitors, passports and legal documents, jewellery over £999 in value, separate parcels strapped or taped together, and badly packaged parcels. We’re happy to carry non-compensation items for delivery, but when you send any of these items it’s at your own risk",[474,478,479,483],{"start":475,"end":476,"type":147,"data":477},364,386,{"link_type":74,"url":269,"target":233},{"start":475,"end":476,"type":145},{"start":480,"end":481,"type":147,"data":482},622,644,{"link_type":74,"url":269,"target":233},{"start":480,"end":481,"type":145},{"questionTitle":485,"questionBody":486},"Can I change the delivery address after I’ve sent a parcel?",[487],{"type":57,"text":488,"spans":489,"direction":84},"Yes. If it’s a simple house name\u002Fnumber change, the easiest thing to do is ask the parcel recipient to divert the parcel to the correct house name\u002Fnumber. If your recipient needs a full address change, keep your eye on the tracking and contact our customer service team with the change you need once the parcel is with the courier. We’ll do our best to get the parcel stopped, and the address corrected before the delivery is made to the original address.",[490,495],{"start":491,"end":492,"type":147,"data":493},103,120,{"link_type":74,"url":494,"target":233},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":491,"end":492,"type":145},{"questionTitle":497,"questionBody":498},"How will I know when my parcel has been delivered?",[499],{"type":57,"text":500,"spans":501,"direction":84},"You can track your parcel as it’s being delivered. This means you can see where your parcel is at each stage of its journey. We’ve explained each stage to make it easy to follow.",[502,506],{"start":503,"end":504,"type":147,"data":505},131,151,{"link_type":74,"url":494,"target":233},{"start":503,"end":504,"type":145},{"title":508},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$c21bd24e-65f0-4f79-b526-c84a7335e442","frequently_asked_questions",[24,46,133,313,348,394,441,466],{"heroCardContent":513},[514],{"id":30,"uid":45,"url":45,"type":31,"href":515,"tags":516,"first_publication_date":34,"last_publication_date":35,"slugs":517,"linked_documents":518,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":519,"data":520},"how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[33],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":521,"heading":530,"headingSupplement":531,"subheading":532,"promoText":533,"headingInternational":534,"headingSupplementInternational":45,"subheadingInternational":45,"promoTextInternational":535,"destination_countries":536,"quickLinks":544,"footerLinks":545,"footerLinksInternational":576,"name":588,"tabName":589,"tabDataGtmTrack":590},{"dimensions":522,"alt":525,"copyright":45,"url":526,"id":527,"edit":528},{"width":523,"height":524},88,24,"Monotype Evri Send Logo","how-to-send-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":68,"y":68,"zoom":70